<title>USA: Dean Foods elects two new officers.</title>
<headline>Dean Foods elects two new officers.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN PARK, Ill. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Foods Co said on Monday that it named William Luegers to the newly created position of corporate controller.</p>
<p>The company also named Gary Rietz to the new position of chief information officer.</p>
<p>Both of the new officers joined Dean Foods within the last year, and will report to William McManaman, vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
